{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30855","headline":"府试水始冰 · 马戴","name":"府试水始冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南池寒色动，北陆岁阴生。\n薄薄流澌聚，漓漓翠潋平。\n暗沾霜稍厚，回照日还轻。\n乳窦悬残滴，湘流减恨声。\n即堪金井贮，会映玉壶清。\n洁白心虽识，空期饮此明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}